          "description": "This table used to carry \"CVEs discovered: 68+ across 71 repos\" while the banner sixty lines above it said zero CVEs have ever been assigned to this project. Both sentences were published on the same page for weeks. Retracting a number at the top of a document does not retract it at the bottom — so the rows below are now dated individually, and anything that cannot be measured says so instead of carrying its old value forward.",
